# The SHA-384 sqlx records for each migration (`_sqlx_migrations.checksum`),
# one line per file: version, checksum, file name. The test in `src/migrate.rs`
# compares every file in `migrations/` against this list.
#
# Append only. A migration, comments included, is frozen once released: sqlx
# checksums the whole file and an edited migration stops every database that
# applied it from starting (#2327). Change the schema with a new migration.
#
# A new migration gets its line from the test: run
# `cargo test -p knobas-db --lib migrate::`; it fails and prints the
# line to append here.
